Yeah.

704
00:54:16,750 --> 00:54:20,030
Is there anything you'd like to add, Martin?

705
00:54:20,030 --> 00:54:23,350
I would really encourage companies, teams, give it a try.

706
00:54:23,350 --> 00:54:25,190
It's not a big investment.

707
00:54:25,190 --> 00:54:29,350
It could be what we did with many clients was just it's called a FedEx day.

708
00:54:29,350 --> 00:54:34,030
FedEx day is just that you take one day and at the end of the day you need to deliver like FedEx.

709
00:54:34,030 --> 00:54:35,870
This could be a perfect starting point.

710
00:54:35,870 --> 00:54:39,590
Take one day and make sure that to deliver something at the end of the day.

711
00:54:39,590 --> 00:54:45,551
And I guarantee you you will be positively surprised what is possible to do within a day if you bring the people together. Okay.

